 "description": "Smarter choices do not have to mean any compromises in other features XO boats have become famous for. XO EXPLR 10 S+ IB has what it takes to take all the elements to the extreme; this bold powerhouse comes with an inboard engine that adds both value and sense to the big picture.\nThanks to the aluminum superstructure, you can spontaneously take your XO ashore without worrying about breaking the hull, and if you suddenly feel like staying at sea overnight, there are berths for that.\nXO EXPLR 10 Sport+ IB version adds a sleeping cabin instead of the open forward cockpit. The front cabin accommodates two people for a good night sleep, hence the inevitable night after a day is not an obstacle for continuing the adventure.\nInspired by Nordic environment and conditions, with its accommodation capacities and weatherproof cover, EXPLR 10 is the perfect boat for the adventurers travelling in all corners of the planet. The boat can be installed with air-conditioning and heater, and like all our boats, it also features our renowned aluminium deep-V hull. XO’s EXPLR 10 is made to exceed all your expectations, no matter the environment or challenge.",
